&lt;li&gt;PhD in machine learning, computer science, electrical engineering, robotics, or related field, and 3+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masters and 4+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of ML fundamentals with hands-on experience in training and evaluating modern ML models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills with experience in deep learning frameworks, e.g., PyTorch, TensorFlow, or Jax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
