&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of 3D geometry and state estimation fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in systems coding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in simulating/modeling real sensors (camera, lidar, radar, IMU, etc), including noise modeling&lt;/li&gt;
