&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house technical recruiting experience at talent dense technology companies, with at least 2 years recruiting for ML, robotics, or infrastructure engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building candidate pipelines through direct/outbound sourcing (not solely inbound or agency-sourced).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering directly with engineering directors/VPs on hiring strategy and role definition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing 10+ concurrent open searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of an ATS (Greenhouse, Lever, or similar) for pipeline tracking and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical fluency with AI-powered recruiting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
