l Media Intern","company_name":"Nuro","first_published":"2026-09-29T15:13:58-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nuro believes self-driving vehicles are the most immediate and profound opportunity for AI to drive positive change in the physical world. Safer streets, more time for what matters, and easier access to the world around us, that’s why we’re building a universal autonomy platform: self-driving for all roads and all rides.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2016, Nuro is a physical AI company developing Level 4 autonomous driving technology for a wide range of vehicles, use cases, and markets. Powered by the Nuro Driver™, our universal autonomy platform enables the global mobility ecosystem to deploy autonomy at scale, from robotaxis and logistics fleets to personal vehicles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With years of real-world deployment experience and a flexible, partner-led business model, Nuro is working toward a future where millions of autonomous vehicles powered by our technology help make everyday life safer, easier, and more connected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nuro has raised over $2B in capital from Uber, NVIDIA, Google, Softbank, Fidelity, T. Rowe Price, and other leading investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nuro is seeking a creative, curious, and digitally fluent Social Media Intern to help grow our presence across social platforms. This is a hands-on content role for someone with strong creative taste, good design instincts, and the analytical ability to make complex ideas clear, relevant, and engaging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help create and publish content across LinkedIn, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube Shorts, X, and other relevant platforms. You’ll also support community management, social listening, executive social, creator outreach, and performance reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate understands internet culture, can translate technical concepts into accessible stories, and knows how to apply brand guidelines with minimal oversight. You should be comfortable experimenting with new formats while exercising sound judgment, strong attention to detail, and a clear point of view.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to Nuro’s Director of Brand &amp;amp; Marketing and works closely with the Head of Content, Head of Communications, and Brand Videographer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, three-month internship with the potential to extend based on performance and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and Publish Social Content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and publish social-first content that brings Nuro’s mission, technology, products, and people to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical concepts, research, and company news into clear, engaging social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn blog posts, announcements, and longer-form stories into short-form video, carousels, graphics, and other platform-native formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write copy and captions tailored to different audiences and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop timely content inspired by relevant trends, cultural moments, and online conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content that reflects strong visual judgment and follows Nuro’s brand guidelines with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify compelling stories, company moments, and subject-matter experts to feature across Nuro’s social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support content development for Nuro’s co-founders and co-CEOs, adapting content to their voices, perspectives, and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas for recurring content series and new storytelling formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Community Management and Social Listening&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor comments, mentions, conversations, and relevant topics across Nuro’s social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to community questions and comments in a timely, thoughtful, and on-brand manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface relevant trends, news, conversations, and opportunities to Brand &amp;amp; Marketing, Communications, Policy &amp;amp; Legal, and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track audience feedback and use insights to inform future content and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain a consistent, accurate, and authentic voice across Nuro’s social presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support social listening for Nuro, its partners, and relevant industry topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and Improve Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review social performance metrics and identify opportunities to improve content, distribution, and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate performance across platforms, audiences, and content formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized social reporting and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance insights to inform creative and editorial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Creator Engagement and Social Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research relevant creators, influencers, publishers, and online communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support outreach, relationship-building, and follow-up for creator opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with influencer campaigns and content collaborations as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help organize content calendars, social assets, copy, approvals, and publishing schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage day-to-day scheduling, publishing, tagging, and content maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to gather information, coordinate reviews, and develop content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure content is accurate, accessible, timely, visually cohesive, and aligned with Nuro’s brand and communications guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current enrollment in or recent graduation from a program in marketing, communications, journalism, media, advertising, business, design, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in social media, content creation, design, online culture, and emerging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of experience creating social content through internships, student organizations, campus publications, personal projects, creator accounts, or similar work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing, editing, and visual storytelling skills, with the ability to adapt voice and format for different platforms and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make technical concepts, research, and complex ideas clear and accessible without oversimplifying them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong design instincts and a clear point of view on composition, typography, visual hierarchy, and what makes content feel polished.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply brand guidelines consistently and make sound creative decisions with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, LinkedIn, X, and other social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video editing and design tools such as CapCut, Adobe Premiere Pro, Adobe Express, Canva, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video production, photography, graphic design, motion graphics, or other visual storytelling formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of social trends, memes, creators, platform conventions, and emerging formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using social analytics and performance data to inform creative decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and attention to detail, with the ability to manage multiple projects, deadlines, and feedback cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment when working with public-facing content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio or examples of relevant social, video, writing, design, or other creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Thrive in This Role If You’re&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious: &lt;/strong&gt;You ask questions, stay informed, and look for the story behind the story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative:&lt;/strong&gt; You generate fresh ideas and enjoy experimenting with new formats, voices, and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience-minded: &lt;/strong&gt;You understand who a piece of content is for and why they should care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourceful: &lt;/strong&gt;You can move an idea forward with limited information or resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative: &lt;/strong&gt;You work well across teams and incorporate feedback constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful: &lt;/strong&gt;You move quickly without sacrificing accuracy, context, or judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-informed: &lt;/strong&gt;You use performance insights to learn, iterate, and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating content for a technology company, executive, or subject-matter expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with social scheduling, listening, or analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in robotics, autonomous vehicles, artificial intelligence, transportation, or emerging technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with influencer marketing, creator partnerships, or community management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For this position, the reasonably expected base hourly rate is $30. Your actual base pay will depend on several factors, including your experience, qualifications, education, location, and skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Nuro, we celebrate differences and are committed to a diverse workplace that fosters inclusion and psychological safety for all employees. Nuro is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and expressly prohibits any form of workplace discrimination based on race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, age, genetic information, disability, veteran status, or any other legally protected characteristics. #LI-DNP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;","departments":[{"id":79174,"name":"Brand","child_ids":[],"parent_id":68795}],"offices":[{"id":23484,"name":"California - HQ","location":"Nuro HQ - Mountain View, CA","child_ids":[],"parent_id":83166}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8222063/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://nuro.ai/careersitem?gh_jid=7351061","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3020580,"location":{"name":"Mountain View, California (HQ)"},"metadata":[{"id":53829309,"name":"Location","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4977510,"name":"Department","value":"Autonomy Platform","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":954897,"name":"Job Family","value":"Autonomy/ML Platform","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4993730,"name":"Time Type","value":"Full-time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4978502,"name":"Worker Sub-Type","value":"Intern","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6653805,"name":"Department (Job Board)","value":"AI Platform General","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6644840,"name":"Org (Job Board)","value":"Software","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":7351061,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:02:43-04:00","requisition_id":"1954","title":"Software Engineer, AI Platform - Intern","company_name":"Nuro","first_published":"2025-10-22T18:23:06-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nuro believes self-driving vehicles are the most immediate and profound opportunity for AI to drive positive change in the physical world. Safer streets, more time for what matters, and easier access to the world around us, that’s why we’re building a universal autonomy platform: self-driving for all roads and all rides.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2016, Nuro is a physical AI company developing Level 4 autonomous driving technology for a wide range of vehicles, use cases, and markets. Powered by the Nuro Driver™, our universal autonomy platform enables the global mobility ecosystem to deploy autonomy at scale, from robotaxis and logistics fleets to personal vehicles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With years of real-world deployment experience and a flexible, partner-led business model, Nuro is working toward a future where millions of autonomous vehicles powered by our technology help make everyday life safer, easier, and more connected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nuro has raised over $2B in capital from Uber, NVIDIA, Google, Softbank, Fidelity, T. Rowe Price, and other leading investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a software engineering intern, you will work closely with leading experts in the field of machine learning, robotics, and software. Depending on your skill sets and areas of interest, you will work on some or all of the following: Data Platform, Onboard Systems, ML Infrastructure, Simulation, or Technical Infrastructure teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your skill set and areas of interest you will work on some or all of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;The Data Platform serves as a comprehensive management system for Nuro AI Driver&#39;s data, labels, and metrics, facilitating seamless access functionality. The team focuses on data annotation across various domains, including 2D/3D perception, mapping, behavior trajectory, and language/text. It also handles data ingestion and mining, employing methods such as heuristics and embedding search. Additionally, the platform supports the autonomy evaluation infrastructure by providing detailed introspection.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboard Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Our onboard system team’s software engineers provide a reliable and high-performance platform that allows our autonomy teams to integrate their autonomy software and algorithms that work across various self-driving platforms. This work requires close collaboration with our software teams, hardware teams, and systems/safety team to make sure new software and hardware work together safely and reliably and resolve onboard error and performance problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ML Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;The ML Infra team is the accelerator to our ML-first autonomy strategy. This team provides solutions to empower machine learning development in Nuro and optimize on-cloud training and onboard inference. Our solutions include a distributed training platform, ML compiler, model components libraries, e.t.c. The team provides opportunities for infra engineers to work fully embedded in ML teams to build cutting edge deep learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simulation: &lt;/strong&gt;The Simulation team builds the simulator that allows us to develop and test our autonomous driving technology in a virtual setting. We work on the core simulator and simulation frameworks, sensor simulation, scenario generation, and solutions that combine real-world data with synthetic techniques to push the boundaries of what can be simulated, collaborating closely with teams across Autonomy and AI Platform to allow us to simulate realistically and reliably at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; this group owns few fundamental services for entire engineering organizations: generic compute platform to host mission-critical workflows such as data processing and simulation, storage management service which manages hundreds of PB of data, cloud infrastructure serves as IaaC which provisions and maintains all cloud resources, engineering productivity provides tools such as build and CI/CD to make engineering work more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have deep expertise and prior experience in some or many of the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a current BS or MS candidate in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Robotics, or a related field &lt;strong&gt;graduating in December 2026 or later&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in one or more of the following areas: backend API design, applications development, large-scale distributed systems; data storage and processing systems; advanced algorithms using C++ and Python; machine learning, multithreading; x86 architecture; and software performance tuning and optimization, robotics software frameworks, different compute modalities (CPU, GPU, FPGA) etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong problem solving and programming skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Nuro, we celebrate differences and are committed to a diverse workplace that fosters inclusion and psychological safety for all employees. Nuro is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and expressly prohibits any form of workplace discrimination based on race, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, age, genetic information, disability, veteran status, or any other legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;","departments":[{"id":247415,"name":"AI Platform","child_ids":[],"parent_id":247414}],"offices":[{"id":23484,"name":"California - HQ","location":"Nuro HQ - Mountain View, CA","child_ids":[],"parent_id":83166}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/7351061/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://nuro.ai/careersitem?gh_jid=7351066","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3019716,"location":{"name":"Mountain View, California (HQ)"},"metadata":[{"id":53829309,"name":"Location","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4977510,"name":"Department","value":"Autonomy Platform","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":954897,"name":"Job Family","value":"Infrastructure","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4993730,"name":"Time Type","value":"Full-time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4978502,"name":"Worker Sub-Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6653805,"name":"Department (Job Board)","value":"AI Platform General","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":6644840,"name":"Org (Job Board)","value":"Software","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":7351066,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:02:43-04:00","requisition_id":"1953","title":"Software Engineer,